EVA-Inspired-Theme — licence
============================

This package is NOT covered by a single licence. It is a layer of our own code
wrapped around third-party material, and the two do not share terms. Read this
file together with NOTICE, which carries the full upstream texts.

The short version, in the order that decides what you may do:

  * Our own code ......... MIT — use it, change it, ship it.
  * Brand marks .......... CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — credit, NO commercial use, share alike.
  * Task sounds .......... MIT (upstream) — but see NOTICE for the voice credit.
  * Great Vibes font ..... SIL OFL 1.1.
  * The wallpaper pair ... NOT distributed and NOT licensed here. Since 2026-10-09
                           the two background images are third-party artwork that
                           this repository does not carry; the tracked manifest
                           links to them instead (D81), so a build paints them
                           from wallhaven; see 2.4.

Because the brand marks forbid commercial use, THE PACKAGE AS A WHOLE IS NOT
COMMERCIAL-USE. That restriction comes from section 2.3, not from the MIT grant
in section 1. If you need a commercial-use build, remove the brand marks.


